          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On Saturday, September 14, 2013, between 11:45 PM and midnight, two witnesses were intrigued by successive ballets of white glowing orbs in the sky. No noise was heard during the observations. The appearance of the phenomenon clearly suggested a \"sky tracer,\" a light projection system used for festive events and nightclubs. A nightclub in Pézenas confirmed using one of these systems exceptionally that night for a special event. Note that the witnesses observed the phenomenon to the South, and the weather report for Montpellier for that evening indicated a cloudy sky, conducive to the beautiful effects of this system. This case is classified \"A\": certain observation of a light display of the \"sky tracer\" type.",
